sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Chat
    participant P as arc-mermaid
    participant E as Engine
    participant G as Molecullage gate
    C->>P: code block appears
    P->>P: wait until the text is stable
    P->>E: parse and lay out candidates
    loop up to ten layouts
        E->>G: score marks
        G-->>E: pass, warn or fail
    end
    E-->>P: best layout as SVG
    P->>C: hide the block, show the card
    Note right of G: stops at the first layout with no warning
